  <item>
    <title>S1E27 这期播客能救命！肺结节离肺癌有多远？中医消结节的真相都在这里了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a70c3c31b5e24969ce861f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a70c3c31b5e24969ce861f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>体检报告上的肺结节三个字，常让许多人陷入焦虑。肺结节一定会变成肺癌吗？磨玻璃结节、实性结节到底哪个更危险？为什么现在肺结节的检出率越来越高？</span></p><p><span>在本期节目中，江泳教授与赵启迪医生将用通俗易懂的语言，从临床定义、诱发因素、良恶性判断、手术指征以及中西医结合治疗等多个维度，为你全面拆解肺结节。你会了解到中医如何通过舌下脉络预判结节，中医能消哪种肺结节，以及在抗癌过程中中医如何发挥扶正的独特优势。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuogB-D137Y_7Hq9SHfmWLL7yVQA.jpg"><p></p><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a>肺结节的定义与界定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="403">06:43</a>为什么现在肺结节这么多见？哪些情况容易诱发肺结节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a>肺结节可以消除吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a>肺结节什么时候需要手术治疗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a>科学随访的建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1576">26:16</a>肺结节良恶性判断，如何判断那些危险的肺结节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1887">31:27</a>肺结节一般没有什么症状，高危人群要注意筛查</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a>肺结节与肺癌的中医治疗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">38:52</a>中医诊断的小绝招</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2553">42:33</a>胸痛，背痛？可能是肺癌的信号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">46:52</a>为什么肺结节检出率激增</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiYKKSBwDMb9SLQcB45LMOAyFwcy.jpg"><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66727f2eb6a8412729d470de/lr5DUsEtN41sFCzXwvCACB7JkF1-.m4a" length="54305106" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:57</itunes:duration>
