    <guid isPermaLink="false">696e636f109824f9e166b8d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhIZWGz2XaahsiUJOA7-JWgvM_RR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a>三九贴、三九灸是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a>哪些人适合做三九贴、三九灸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a>如何避免起泡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">09:21</a>三九贴掉了，还能自己再粘回去吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a>三九贴、三九灸期间的饮食注意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a>哪些人不适合三九贴、三九灸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a>冬季养生关于进补的三个误区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a>冬季养生关于封藏的一些误区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a>冬季养生关于御寒的一些误区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a>冬季养生原则：一饭二茶三动一世界</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加主播微信，lanyu1236123（备注：漫谈中医）</span></p>]]></description>
