  <item>
    <title>S1E19 这届年轻人三高不请自来？一集惜命指南带你早期预防和控制血脂、血糖、血压、尿酸临界的代谢综合征</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6907922548dbe0eb56128a2f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6907922548dbe0eb56128a2f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Nov 2025 17:28:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>江老师，出身中医世家，自幼接受中医的熏陶，长期进行常见病、疑难杂病的临床研究，硕博士学习结束后，步入临床的她面对中医临床的各种问题进行思考，走上了中西医结合的道路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈兆兴医生，年少酷爱中医，辗转学习研修，主攻仲景医学</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a>什么是代谢综合征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a>瘦子也可能有代谢综合征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a>代谢综合征是中医治疗非常优势的疾病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">07:29</a>提前干预，就能少吃药或者不吃药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a>哪些原因导致了代谢综合征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a>代谢综合征的影响和危害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a>有代谢综合征应该怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a>对运动的一些建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1491">24:51</a>临界高血压运动不建议太剧烈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a>代谢综合征一般怎么治疗，西药一般会低剂量，短期用药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a>代谢综合征中医治疗的方法和优势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a>预防代谢综合征的一些常见中药和保健品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2751">45:51</a>治疗与保健是不一样的</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加主播微信，lanyu1236123（备注：漫谈中医）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66727f2eb6a8412729d470de/lobKAEfVytZACDaIKpCCC961yfpz.m4a" length="67834997" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3ypDMGm7xyD2SEhy1y3OHM8Hk6.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S1E18 医圣的千层套路（九）病性与侧重</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c96959a56ca3e0c4beba12</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c96959a56ca3e0c4beba12</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Sep 2025 13:49:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;麻黄汤和桂枝汤是我们刚开始学习方剂时就会接触的两首基础方，但是它们可不像表面上看起来这么简单哟。比如，桂枝汤治疗的是实证还是虚证呢？它们背后还藏着什么样的秘密呢？这期节目就会揭晓啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>江老师，出身中医世家，自幼接受中医的熏陶，长期进行常见病、疑难杂病的临床研究，硕博士学习结束后，步入临床的她面对中医临床的各种问题进行思考，走上了中西医结合的道路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>病性常常是错杂的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a>桂枝汤VS麻黄汤：它们针对是实证还是虚证？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a>即使是最简单的感冒（外感风寒），病机也是错杂的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a>侧重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a>麻黄汤侧重于寒邪，桂枝汤侧重于风邪。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a>麻黄汤症状特点侧重于痛（寒邪更重）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a>麻黄汤用药解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a>桂枝汤症状特点侧重于痒（风邪更重）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a>过敏性鼻炎的小朋友未及时治疗可能继发抽动症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a>桂枝汤用药解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a>桂枝汤中的芍药VS当归四逆汤中的当归（病位浅深）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1887">31:27</a>桂枝汤适合用于过敏性鼻炎发作期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a>侧重——谁重就重点治谁，谁轻就佐以治谁,一样就平分秋色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>侧重在张仲景治疗黄疸中的体现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a>侧重一些待延伸的点</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加主播微信，lanyu1236123（备注：漫谈中医）</span></p>]]></description>
